# Project Structure Guide

- Entry points
  - Runner: [run_neural_cssr.py](mdc:run_neural_cssr.py)
  - Docs: [docs/neural_cssr_pipeline.md](mdc:docs/neural_cssr_pipeline.md)

- Neural models
  - Language Model (standard: nanoGPT): [nanoGPT](mdc:nanoGPT)
    - Configs: [nanoGPT/config/train_golden_mean_char.py](mdc:nanoGPT/config/train_golden_mean_char.py), [nanoGPT/config/train_even_process_char.py](mdc:nanoGPT/config/train_even_process_char.py)
    - Workflow: [docs/neural_cssr_pipeline.md](mdc:docs/neural_cssr_pipeline.md), [docs/experiments_golden_mean.md](mdc:docs/experiments_golden_mean.md)
  - Research prototype (internal transformer): [src/neural_cssr/neural/transformer.py](mdc:src/neural_cssr/neural/transformer.py)
  - EBM (self-contained): [notebook_experiments/ebt/models.py](mdc:notebook_experiments/ebt/models.py)

- EBM training & evaluation
  - Train script: [notebook_experiments/ebt/train_golden_mean.py](mdc:notebook_experiments/ebt/train_golden_mean.py)
  - Dataset check (Even Process): [notebook_experiments/ebt/check_even_dataset.py](mdc:notebook_experiments/ebt/check_even_dataset.py)
  - Cross-eval / generation: [notebook_experiments/ebt/eval_ebm.py](mdc:notebook_experiments/ebt/eval_ebm.py)
  - Experiment log: [notebook_experiments/ebt/experiment_even_vs_gm.mdc](mdc:notebook_experiments/ebt/experiment_even_vs_gm.mdc)

- Data generation
  - FSM generator: [pysm_generator.py](mdc:pysm_generator.py)
  - Golden Mean data: [notebook_experiments/golden_mean/data/golden_mean/golden_mean.dat](mdc:notebook_experiments/golden_mean/data/golden_mean/golden_mean.dat)
  - Even Process data: [notebook_experiments/even_process/even_process.dat](mdc:notebook_experiments/even_process/even_process.dat)

Notes
- Datasets are 0/1 text sequences.
- Prefer absolute paths in commands; `uv run` is used to manage deps.
